# BuildKit reads this for orchestrator/Dockerfile only (the build context is
# the repo root). Host-side dashboard artifacts must never reach the web
# stage: node_modules is installed there by npm ci, dist/ is built there.
orchestrator/web/node_modules
orchestrator/web/dist
orchestrator/web/test-results
orchestrator/web/playwright-report
orchestrator/wwwroot
# tools/visual.sh's own baseline-snapshot directory, bind-mounted into its
# Docker container -- an abnormally-terminated run can leave a symlink here
# pointing at the container-internal path (/o/web/...), which is broken on
# the host and makes BuildKit's context uploader fail outright ("invalid
# file request"). Never needed in the image regardless.
orchestrator/web/.visual
